      "content": "i mean, i've been feeling a bit of a flutter in my chest too, like my heart is skipping a beat or racing a little bit every now and then. it's not constant, just happens when i'm sitting still. does that sound like it could just be part of the dehydration/tiredness too? i'd rather just try some electrolytes and rest up for a few days before i go making a whole thing out of it.",
